WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.400
-This was
when Barack Obama was president

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.600
of the United States.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.967
And while we were once driving

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:22.967
through a struggling
neighborhood in Chicago,

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:28.167
he commented that only Black
people could live that way.

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.567
-Attorney-client privilege.

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:31.133
Yes. I will turn it over to you.

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.000
-You, as my friend Mr. Meadows
pointed out,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.700
misled this committee even today
in a written submission

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.567
that contradicted
your testimony.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.700
You have suggested
you are going to review that.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.167
Did you review?

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:40.767
Are you going to review it
in our next break

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:42.133
to correct the record,
yes or no?

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.800
-Yes.
-Question.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.667
You helped out the president's
campaign

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.967
or were involved in the campaign
as a representative,

00:00:47.967 --> 00:00:49.867
as a spokesman,
even in your words today,

00:00:49.867 --> 00:00:53.000
it was your idea for the
campaign dating back to 2011.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.233
Is that accurate?

00:00:54.233 --> 00:00:55.867
Yes or no?
-Yes.

00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:58.633
-Mr. Weisselberg
and other individuals,

00:00:58.633 --> 00:01:01.133
Miss Rhona.
Who are those individuals?

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.133
Are they with
the Trump Organization

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:06.233
or are there other people
that we should be meeting with?

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:10.267
-So Allen Weisselberg is
the chief financial officer.

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:12.633
-You got to quickly give us
as many names as you can

00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:13.800
so we can get to them.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.367
-Yes, ma'am.

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:17.267
-Is Miss Rhona --
what is Miss Rhona's --

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:20.700
-Rhona is the -- Mr. Trump's
executive assistant.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.433
-And would she be able
to corroborate many

00:01:22.433 --> 00:01:23.633
of the statements
that you've made here?

00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:24.800
-Yes. She was --

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.233
her office is directly next
to his,

00:01:27.233 --> 00:01:32.333
and she's involved in a lot
that went on.

